<p>
Holy God,
</p>

<p>
In my haste to be heard,<br>
give me the strength<br>
to slow down,<br>
think carefully,<br>
and measure<br>
my words.
</p>

<p>
Some words are poisonous fruit,<br>
and others are seeds of grace.
</p>

<p>
Help me to sow<br>
according to your will.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


